{"id":"u-f66769de-3aee-4943-be90-94d3438e18e7","src":"community","title":"Hybrid Athlete Full-Body Program","author":"Chen E.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/YjQx3S-hybrid-athlete-full-body-program","desc":"The Hybrid Athlete Full-Body Program is designed to combine strength, hypertrophy, agility, and athletic performance to cater to athletes who want to build muscle, enhance strength, and improve their agility and athleticism. This program is ideal for individuals who are active in sports like soccer, where a combination of power, speed, and endurance is crucial.\n\nDay 1: Monday - Strength and Hypertrophy Focus\n\nGoal: Build overall muscle strength and size.\nKey Points: Focus on compound movements. Superset exercises to maximize efficiency. Maintain high intensity with RPE 8-9.\nNotes: Rest 90 seconds between supersets. Prioritize form and controlled movements.\n\nDay 2: Wednesday - Agility and Athletic Performance Focus\n\nGoal: Enhance speed, power, and coordination.\nKey Points: Incorporate explosive and functional movements. Emphasize quick, powerful actions. Maintain high intensity with RPE 8-9.\nNotes: Rest 60-90 seconds between exercises. Focus on explosive starts and soft landings.\n\nDay 3: Friday - Combined Focus\n\nGoal: Blend strength, hypertrophy, and agility.\nKey Points: Use a mix of compound and isolation exercises. Balance strength work with agility drills. Maintain high intensity with RPE 8-9.\nNotes: Rest 60-90 seconds between exercises. Ensure a full range of motion and proper form.\nAdditional Tips\nWarm-Up: Perform a 10-15 minute warm-up before each session to prepare your muscles and joints.\nCool Down: Spend 10 minutes stretching post-workout to enhance recovery and flexibility.\nProgression: Gradually increase weights and intensity over the 8 weeks.\nRecovery: Prioritize rest days for muscle recovery. Ensure adequate sleep and nutrition.\nThis approach will ensure balanced development of strength, muscle size, agility, and athletic performance.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":17,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-05-11T14:03:19.701Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Strength & Hypertrophy Focus","Agility & Athletic Performance","Combined Focus"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":4}],"note":"Rest: 90 seconds between supersets"}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Dumbbell Row","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":4}]}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":4}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Bicep Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Rest: 60 seconds between supersets"}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Russian Twist (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"sec":30,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":30,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicycle Crunch","sets":[{"sec":30,"rpe":9,"x":3}],"note":"Rest: 60 seconds between rounds"}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Treadmill Sprints","sets":[{"sec":1200,"secHi":1800,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":5}],"note":"20 - 30 Seconds.\nRest: 90 seconds between sets"},{"ss":[{"n":"Jump Squat","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Box Jump","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":4}],"note":"Rest: 60 seconds between supersets"}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Lateral Jump","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":4}],"note":"4 sets of 15 reps per side (RPE 8-9)"},{"n":"High Knees","sets":[{"sec":1800,"secHi":2700,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":4}],"note":"4 sets of 30-45 seconds \n\nRest: 60 seconds between supersets"}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Single Leg Romanian Deadlift","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Lunge","sets"